DESCRIPTION:Project: Planning Study Community Consultation Meetings\n\nJoi
 n us for the Woodbine Secondary Plan Study and Transportation Master Plan 
 Open House #2 to learn more about the emerging directions on the Secondary
  Plan Study\, including the draft Urban Design Guidelines. For the Transpo
 rtation Master Plan\, you will have the opportunity to consider the evalua
 tion criteria and evaluation of the two alternative solutions being review
 ed for the Woodbine Lands and the multi-modal network options being consid
 ered for the larger Context Area. Preliminary preferred alternatives and o
 ptions will be identified together with any site-specific studies\, issues
  and key mitigation measures.\n\nType: In person
